  {
   "id": "life-is-strange-double-exposure-305158@post-2024-11-14",
   "gameId": "life-is-strange-double-exposure-305158",
   "displayName": "Life is Strange: Double Exposure Patch Notes - November 14 2024",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-11-14T16:05:22.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Credits have been updated.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Shift Spot Audio has been updated.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(PC Only) Resolved an issue in Chapter 1 where it shows a controller tutorial instead of a keyboard tutorial for keyboard & mouse users.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue in Chapter 1 where Safi’s voice lines aren’t playing when taking her snapshot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "(German only) Resolved an issue in Chapter 1 where part of the text in the Caledon acceptance letter is in the wrong language.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue in Chapter 2 where after talking to Lucas in the living timeline, users can step on the chair where Lucas was sitting.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue in Chapter 2 where under certain circumstances when sneaking around in Moses' office to get Safi’s camera, Max can’t go downstairs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue upon completion of Chapter 2 where the thumbnail for 'Samson the Hellerton House Plant’ and ‘Gwen’s Plant' watering can choice are the wrong way round (sorry Samson).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue in Chapter 3 where incorrect objectives would be shown after speaking to Lucas.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue in Chapter 3 where the objective wouldn’t correctly update after talking to Vinh in the living world.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated one of the objectives in Chapter 3 to be clearer on which world to find information about Maya.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue upon completion of Chapter 3 where Max's hair clips through her skull on a 'Giving Vinh a Secret' choice thumbnail on the End of Chapter Screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Under certain circumstances, Max forgot to change out of her indoor fit in Chapter 4. This is now fixed and Max now wearing the right outfit.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue if a player uses Explore Scene in Chapter 4 where NPCs are Misplaced during the Krampus Roast.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue in Chapter 4 where static noise unexpectedly plays under certain conditions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Russian Terms of Service has been updated with the correct date.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Outstanding Issues",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "There are a few issues we are aware of and are looking to fix in an upcoming patch. These include:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Missing voice lines in Chapter 5.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Infinite loading issues on PC, affecting a small number of players/hardware configurations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Achievements not appearing from Early Access into full launch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you are still facing issues, please message our support team here: https://sqex.link/16c1b4",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
